metical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithForm}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\)</span> (arithmetic formula set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((v_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (fixed enumeration of arithmetic variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}(\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}(\\theta)\\)</span> (universal closure in increasing variable-index order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}_x(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ind}_x(\\varphi)\\)</span> (induction instance before closing parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano arithmetic theory)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ind}_x(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x\\;(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[\\mathsf s(x)/x])\\bigr)\n\\to\\forall x\\;\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ind}_x(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x\\;(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[\\mathsf s(x)/x])\\bigr)\n\\to\\forall x\\;\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\left.\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{free}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\theta)\n=\\{v_{i_1},\\ldots,v_{i_m}\\},\\\\\ni_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_m\n\\end{gathered}\n\\right\\}\n\\to\n\\operatorname{ucl}(\\theta)\n\\coloneqq\\forall v_{i_1}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_m}\\;\\theta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\left.\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{free}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\theta)\n=\\{v_{i_1},\\ldots,v_{i_m}\\},\\\\\ni_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_m\n\\end{gathered}\n\\right\\}\n\\to\n\\operatorname{ucl}(\\theta)\n\\coloneqq\\forall v_{i_1}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_m}\\;\\theta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PA}\\coloneqq Q\\cup\n\\bigl\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\operatorname{Ind}_x(\\varphi)):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\land\nx\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PA}\\coloneqq Q\\cup\n\\bigl\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\operatorname{Ind}_x(\\varphi)):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\land\nx\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\mathrm{PA})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\mathrm{PA})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对带参数的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，归纳实例先形成，再对其余自由变量作固定次序的\n全称闭包；这保证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>是句子集，而不是含游离参数的公式集。</li>\n<li>代入符号表示无变量捕获的句法代入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3f44d69945b890a4","anchor":"ref